WEBVTT

1
00:07:24.903 --> 00:07:28.490
How are the presales
for Silent Death looking?

2
00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:40.419
We need this deal.

3
00:07:50.095 --> 00:07:53.640
We were beginning to worry
we might never see you again.

4
00:07:55.851 --> 00:07:57.102
How were finals?

5
00:07:58.061 --> 00:07:58.937
Okay.

6
00:07:59.146 --> 00:08:00.439
Just okay, huh?

7
00:08:08.155 --> 00:08:08.989
It's nice to see you.

8
00:08:09.323 --> 00:08:10.157
You too.

9
00:08:25.422 --> 00:08:27.049
They're gonna unpack.

10
00:08:37.935 --> 00:08:39.353
He's protecting us.

11
00:08:40.187 --> 00:08:44.233
How's it going with Alexandra?

12
00:08:51.657 --> 00:08:52.491
They broke up.

13
00:08:53.033 --> 00:08:54.701
Now is your chance.

14
00:09:04.169 --> 00:09:07.089
Someone is waiting for you.

15
00:09:15.806 --> 00:09:17.599
I'm glad to have you back.

16
00:09:17.975 --> 00:09:21.353
Sorry to have to rush off for work,
but I'll be back in a few days.

17
00:09:22.688 --> 00:09:27.192
It's fine, Dad. We're used to it.

18
00:17:49.194 --> 00:17:53.823
Have you been fighting
with the neighbors again?

19
00:17:56.785 --> 00:17:58.411
Of course you'd deny it.

20
00:19:00.765 --> 00:19:02.392
Breakfast anyone?

21
00:19:02.725 --> 00:19:03.560
What is it?

22
00:19:03.935 --> 00:19:08.648
A mongoose got into Ben's enclosure
and bit him.

23
00:19:10.441 --> 00:19:11.484
Is he okay?

24
00:19:12.402 --> 00:19:14.404
It will get better in two or three days.

25
00:19:14.863 --> 00:19:15.697
Oh, ok.

26
00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:19.367
I'll send the mongoose in for testing.

27
00:19:19.784 --> 00:19:21.619
See what it says. You never know.

28
00:19:22.328 --> 00:19:26.958
I'll call Lambert later and see
if he can swing by after work

29
00:19:27.417 --> 00:19:29.419
and clean out the cage.

30
00:19:29.878 --> 00:19:31.254
Bring some antibiotics.

31
00:19:32.005 --> 00:19:35.008
Leave Ben locked up until then.

32
00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:36.134
I will.

33
00:19:43.641 --> 00:19:46.227
Are you excited Lucy is home?

34
00:19:48.104 --> 00:19:49.606
She has her friends.

35
00:19:53.776 --> 00:19:59.157
The three of us will have so much fun
when I'm back.

36
00:19:59.449 --> 00:20:01.034
Doing what?

37
00:20:01.868 --> 00:20:04.287
I'll think of something.

38
00:20:05.371 --> 00:20:07.665
- Lame.
- Boring.

39
00:53:11.063 --> 00:53:12.773
Stay here.

40
01:22:32.823 --> 01:22:34.241
Everything will be fine.

41
01:22:37.620 --> 01:22:39.038
I love you.

42
01:22:39.538 --> 01:22:40.748
I love you too.

43
01:22:43.084 --> 01:22:45.461
I should never have left you.

44
01:22:46.337 --> 01:22:47.880
You're here now.
